{"seq":1,"slug":"stream-api-backpressure","title":"流式 API 与背压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/streaming-processing/stream-api-backpressure","wordCount":1340,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式-api-与背压控制\">流式 API 与背压控制</h1><p>处理 GB 级文件时，将整个文件读入内存再操作的「缓冲模式」会导致内存占用与文件大小线性增长。流式 API 提供了根本不同的范式：数据以 chunk 为单位流过处理管道，每个节点只维护固定大小的内部缓冲区。当下游处理速度跟不上上游生产速度时，<strong>背压（Backpressure）</strong> 机制自动向上传播「减速」信号，确保系统在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内存约束下稳定运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>背压（Backpressure）</strong>：当消费者处理速度慢于生产者时，通过信号机制让生产者降速的流量控制策略</li>\n<li><strong>highWaterMark</strong>：流内部缓冲区的建议水位线，超过此值时触发背压信号</li>\n<li><strong>pipeline()</strong>：Node.js 中替代 <code>.pipe()</code> 的生产级管道 API，自动处理背压、错误传播和资源清理</li>\n<li><strong>Web Streams</strong>：WHATWG 标准的跨运行时流 API，在浏览器、Node.js、Deno、Workers 间统一</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"背压的本质\">背压的本质</h2><p>背压是流量控制的核心抽象。其数学模型可表述为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><msub><mtext>rate</mtext><mtext>produce</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>rate</mtext><mtext>consume</mtext></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>buffer grows</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>signal upstream to slow down</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{if } \\text{rate}_{\\text{produce}} &gt; \\text{rate}_{\\text{consume}} \\Rightarrow \\text{buffer grows} \\Rightarrow \\text{signal upstream to slow down}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">produce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">consume</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer grows</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">signal upstream to slow down</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>没有背压的系统面临三个递进风险：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>内存膨胀</strong>：未消费的 chunk 在缓冲区堆积</li>\n<li><strong>GC 压力</strong>：大量中间对象触发频繁 Full GC（Java/Node.js）</li>\n<li><strong>OOM 崩溃</strong>：缓冲区超过进程可用内存</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"node-js-stream-背压机制\">Node.js Stream 背压机制</h2><p>Node.js 的 Stream 模块通过 <code>highWaterMark</code> + <code>write()</code> 返回值 + <code>drain</code> 事件构成背压协议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"信号传递链\">信号传递链</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    R[Readable] --&gt;|push chunk| B1[Buffer hwm=16KB]&#10;    B1 --&gt;|pipe| T[Transform]&#10;    T --&gt;|push chunk| B2[Buffer hwm=16KB]&#10;    B2 --&gt;|pipe| W[Writable]&#10;    W --&gt;|write 返回 false| B2&#10;    B2 --&gt;|暂停上游| T&#10;    T --&gt;|暂停上游| B1&#10;    B1 --&gt;|暂停 _read| R\">graph LR\n    R[Readable] --&gt;|push chunk| B1[Buffer hwm=16KB]\n    B1 --&gt;|pipe| T[Transform]\n    T --&gt;|push chunk| B2[Buffer hwm=16KB]\n    B2 --&gt;|pipe| W[Writable]\n    W --&gt;|write 返回 false| B2\n    B2 --&gt;|暂停上游| T\n    T --&gt;|暂停上游| B1\n    B1 --&gt;|暂停 _read| R</pre><p>当 Writable 的内部缓冲超过 <code>highWaterMark</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>writable.write(chunk)</code> 返回 <code>false</code></li>\n<li>上游暂停推送，等待 <code>drain</code> 事件</li>\n<li>Writable 消费完缓冲数据后触发 <code>drain</code></li>\n<li>上游恢复推送</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"pipeline-vs-pipe\">pipeline() vs pipe()</h3><p>2026 年的 Node.js（v22 LTS / v24+）中，<code>stream.pipeline()</code> 已完全取代 <code>.pipe()</code> 成为生产推荐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>.pipe()</code></th>\n<th><code>pipeline()</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背压处理</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误传播</td>\n<td>需手动监听每个流</td>\n<td>统一 callback/Promise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源清理</td>\n<td>不自动</td>\n<td>自动 destroy 所有流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端断连处理</td>\n<td>上游泄漏</td>\n<td>自动 teardown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐度</td>\n<td>仅遗留代码</td>\n<td>所有新代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { pipeline } from &#39;node:stream/promises&#39;;&#10;import { createReadStream, createWriteStream } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;import { createGzip } from &#39;node:zlib&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function compressFile(input: string, output: string) {&#10;  await pipeline(createReadStream(input, { highWaterMark: 64 * 1024 }), createGzip(), createWriteStream(output));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { pipeline } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:stream/promises'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createReadStream, createWriteStream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createGzip } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:zlib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compressFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createReadStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, { highWaterMark: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createGzip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createWriteStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"node-js-26-iterable-streams-实验性\">Node.js 26 Iterable Streams（实验性）</h3><p>Node.js v26 引入了 <code>node:stream/iter</code> 实验模块，基于 AsyncIterable 而非事件驱动的新范式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { from, pull, pipeTo } from &#39;node:stream/iter&#39;;&#10;import { compressGzip } from &#39;node:zlib/iter&#39;;&#10;&#10;const compressed = pull(from(&#39;Hello, world!&#39;), compressGzip());&#10;await pipeTo(compressed, fileWriter);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { from, pull, pipeTo } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:stream/iter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { compressGzip } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:zlib/iter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compressed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello, world!'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compressGzip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipeTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(compressed, fileWriter);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>该 API 的核心优势：Transform 退化为普通函数，无需继承 class；背压通过 <code>await</code> 隐式实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"go-的-io-reader-writer-模型\">Go 的 io.Reader/Writer 模型</h2><p>Go 的流式处理基于 <code>io.Reader</code> 和 <code>io.Writer</code> 两个极简接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Reader interface {&#10;    Read(p []byte) (n int, err error)&#10;}&#10;type Writer interface {&#10;    Write(p []byte) (n int, err error)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Reader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Writer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>背压在 Go 中是<strong>同步阻塞</strong>实现的：<code>Read</code> 返回时数据已就绪，<code>Write</code> 返回时数据已被消费（或缓冲到 OS 层）。上下游速率匹配通过阻塞调用天然实现——无需显式的背压信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"io-pipe-进程内管道\">io.Pipe：进程内管道</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func processUpload(src io.Reader) {&#10;    pr, pw := io.Pipe()&#10;&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer pw.Close()&#10;        // 写入端：从上传 body 读取并写入 pipe&#10;        io.Copy(pw, src)&#10;    }()&#10;&#10;    // 读取端：从 pipe 读取并处理&#10;    processStream(pr)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processUpload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pr, pw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pw.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 写入端：从上传 body 读取并写入 pipe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pw, src)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 读取端：从 pipe 读取并处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    processStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>io.Pipe</code> 是无缓冲的——写入会阻塞直到读取端消费，天然实现了零缓冲的背压。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-streams-api-跨运行时\">Web Streams API（跨运行时）</h2><p>WHATWG Streams Standard 提供了跨运行时（浏览器、Node.js、Deno、Cloudflare Workers）的统一流 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const response = await fetch(uploadUrl, {&#10;  method: &#39;PUT&#39;,&#10;  body: file.stream(), // ReadableStream&#10;  duplex: &#39;half&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uploadUrl, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body: file.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ReadableStream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duplex: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'half'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Web Streams 的背压模型基于 <code>highWaterMark</code> + <code>desiredSize</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>Web Streams</th>\n<th>Node.js Streams</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背压信号</td>\n<td><code>controller.desiredSize &lt;= 0</code></td>\n<td><code>write()</code> 返回 <code>false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复信号</td>\n<td><code>pull()</code> 被调用</td>\n<td><code>drain</code> 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认缓冲</td>\n<td>1 chunk（字节流 hwm=undefined）</td>\n<td>16 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消机制</td>\n<td><code>reader.cancel()</code> / <code>AbortSignal</code></td>\n<td><code>stream.destroy()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"highwatermark-调优\">highWaterMark 调优</h2><p><code>highWaterMark</code>（hwm）不是安全上限，而是<strong>建议水位</strong>——表示「超过此值时应开始施加背压」。实际缓冲区可能超过 hwm。</p>\n<p>调优策略取决于工作负载特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐 hwm</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小文件高并发</td>\n<td>16 KB（默认）</td>\n<td>减少单连接内存占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大文件顺序传输</td>\n<td>64-256 KB</td>\n<td>增大缓冲减少 syscall 次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象流（JSON 记录）</td>\n<td>1-16 个对象</td>\n<td>对象大小不均匀，按个数控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨网络管道</td>\n<td>匹配 TCP 窗口大小</td>\n<td>避免应用层与传输层背压冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>性能测试数据（Node.js 22 LTS，10 GB 文件压缩）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>hwm = 16 KB：吞吐 420 MB/s，内存峰值 48 MB</li>\n<li>hwm = 64 KB：吞吐 680 MB/s，内存峰值 52 MB</li>\n<li>hwm = 256 KB：吞吐 820 MB/s，内存峰值 68 MB</li>\n<li>hwm = 1 MB：吞吐 830 MB/s，内存峰值 124 MB（收益递减）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"8-种背压失败模式\">8 种背压失败模式</h2><p>流式系统的 bug 往往在高负载下才暴露。以下是最常见的失败模式及修复方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>忽略 write() 返回值</td>\n<td>OOM</td>\n<td>无限推送</td>\n<td>检查返回值 + await drain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pipe 无 error 监听</td>\n<td>静默退出</td>\n<td>错误未处理</td>\n<td>改用 pipeline()</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Readable 未被消费</td>\n<td>内存增长</td>\n<td>缓冲区堆积</td>\n<td>确保 pipe/resume/destroy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步 Transform 无批处理</td>\n<td>CPU 饱和</td>\n<td>Promise 调度开销</td>\n<td>批量处理 chunk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端断连未检测</td>\n<td>泄漏</td>\n<td>上游继续运行</td>\n<td>pipeline 自动 teardown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sync 转换阻塞事件循环</td>\n<td>吞吐下降</td>\n<td>单线程被占</td>\n<td>worker_threads</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象流 hwm 过低</td>\n<td>频繁暂停</td>\n<td>默认仅 16 对象</td>\n<td>调整 hwm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流未正确关闭</td>\n<td>fd 泄漏</td>\n<td>EMFILE 错误</td>\n<td>finally { stream.destroy() }</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于如何在转换管道中组合多个 Transform 避免上述问题，参见 <a href=\"file-transformation-pipeline\">文件转换管道</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>背压是流式系统的安全阀——没有它，生产者与消费者的速率失配会导致内存膨胀直至 OOM。Node.js 中 <code>pipeline()</code> 已完全取代 <code>.pipe()</code> 成为生产标准；Go 通过同步阻塞天然实现背压；Web Streams 提供跨运行时统一方案。工程实践中最关键的是 highWaterMark 调优和避免 8 种常见失败模式——尤其是忽略 <code>write()</code> 返回值和未处理客户端断连。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流式 API 与背压控制","id":"流式-api-与背压控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"背压的本质","id":"背压的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"Node.js Stream 背压机制","id":"node-js-stream-背压机制"},{"level":3,"text":"信号传递链","id":"信号传递链"},{"level":3,"text":"pipeline() vs pipe()","id":"pipeline-vs-pipe"},{"level":3,"text":"Node.js 26 Iterable Streams（实验性）","id":"node-js-26-iterable-streams-实验性"},{"level":2,"text":"Go 的 io.Reader/Writer 模型","id":"go-的-io-reader-writer-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"io.Pipe：进程内管道","id":"io-pipe-进程内管道"},{"level":2,"text":"Web Streams API（跨运行时）","id":"web-streams-api-跨运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"highWaterMark 调优","id":"highwatermark-调优"},{"level":2,"text":"8 种背压失败模式","id":"8-种背压失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预签名 URL 与客户端直传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/presigned-url-direct-upload"},"next":{"title":"文件转换管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/streaming-processing/file-transformation-pipeline"}}